{"items":[{"id":"1674146340606005248","title":"大家想看我写当时买信托的故事嘛？ 不行…","content":"<p>大家想看我写当时买信托的故事嘛？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;不行的话，我给大家看看我当时我用信托积分换的锅？</p>","excerpt":"大家想看我写当时买信托的故事嘛？ 不行…","voteupCount":99,"commentCount":11,"created":1691927591,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1674146340606005248"},{"id":"1674073082728853504","title":"怎么说呢？ 作为一个2021年清完了所有信…","content":"<p>怎么说呢？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;作为一个2021年清完了所有信托的人，看到朋友圈这个消息，心里还是有点感慨的。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-ad76263d95639658423baf11dc6ca9ba_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"567\">","excerpt":"怎么说呢？ 作为一个2021年清完了所有信…","voteupCount":74,"commentCount":10,"created":1691910125,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1674073082728853504"},{"id":"1672602377235509248","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-1d2ecd6f81e20d1691b7875503a092d1_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"240\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":184,"commentCount":11,"created":1691559482,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1672602377235509248"},{"id":"1672202734903173120","title":"上岸第一剑，先斩意中人","content":"<p>上岸第一剑，先斩意中人</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-00fbacefff43a685e1d284450d5ecdb6_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"497\" height=\"1247\">","excerpt":"上岸第一剑，先斩意中人","voteupCount":116,"commentCount":14,"created":1691464206,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1672202734903173120"},{"id":"1671283769733697536","title":"要不过两天给你们写写江浙沪炒房团的玩法…","content":"<p>要不过两天给你们写写江浙沪炒房团的玩法吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;就现在你们看到知乎写的炒房团玩法，百分之九十九，都是假的。</p>","excerpt":"要不过两天给你们写写江浙沪炒房团的玩法…","voteupCount":185,"commentCount":21,"created":1691245101,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1671283769733697536"},{"id":"1670893256006209536","title":"这种援助力度，爱了爱了","content":"<p>这种援助力度，爱了爱了</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-79bd735cf4c72828f0f6f36ddc63a42c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"260\">","excerpt":"这种援助力度，爱了爱了","voteupCount":162,"commentCount":13,"created":1691152018,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1670893256006209536"},{"id":"1670748870987464704","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-083b254720f854131023cdc284bc09a6_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1540\" height=\"796\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-28a85901d54d89d72fd61d145eb4f3f2_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1013\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":118,"commentCount":14,"created":1691117577,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1670748870987464704"},{"id":"1668279171598712832","title":"我现在的主要矛盾是悲观预期和持仓还行之…","content":"<p>我现在的主要矛盾是悲观预期和持仓还行之间的矛盾。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-f274f6758b9a285b48f512382404aa8a_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1071\" height=\"684\">","excerpt":"我现在的主要矛盾是悲观预期和持仓还行之…","voteupCount":73,"commentCount":37,"created":1690528749,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1668279171598712832"},{"id":"1667891031851806720","title":"还是那个富哥们，有多离谱吧？ 他家狗死…","content":"<p>还是那个富哥们，有多离谱吧？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他家狗死了，他太伤心了，给狗子整个了5万块的墓地。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我不理解，我大为震撼。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-c0998faf9995bcdab5fa42613050b949_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\">","excerpt":"还是那个富哥们，有多离谱吧？ 他家狗死…","voteupCount":75,"commentCount":9,"created":1690436267,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1667891031851806720"},{"id":"1667624051265839104","title":"跟一个富哥们聊彩礼这个事","content":"<p>跟一个富哥们聊彩礼这个事。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;富哥们很随意，说没有女生问我要高彩礼。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：？？？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他：为什么鳄鱼不吃饲养员？饱一顿还是顿顿饱这个道理，连鳄鱼都知道，人会不知道吗？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：(=_=)</p>","excerpt":"跟一个富哥们聊彩礼这个事","voteupCount":113,"commentCount":10,"created":1690372666,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1667624051265839104"}]}